              "text": "SPEED Section 112(1) No person shall drive a motor vehicle in any public place at a speed exceeding the maximum speed, or lower than the minimum speed, fixed for that vehicle or class of vehicle under this Act. Drivers must stay within the maximum and minimum speed limits set for their vehicle class; the enabling section itself does not set the numeric limits, which come from separate central/state notifications (see legal_sources: SRC_SPEEDLIMIT_SO1522E_2018). Speed limit check for light motor vehicles Speed limit check for geared motorcycles Speed limit check for heavy goods vehicles",
